					# 2.3 B4: SENDING MODE. Shown while the god has a pending send (a prayer's "Send a child" or Retribution's):
					# who the child goes to, the price, and Cancel (clears the pending send; the prayer stays open). Closing
					# the window keeps the pending send, so this shows again on reopening. A vbox (a widget does not size to
					# its children); the recipient is the datacontext of the container (a leaf text's own is not honoured).
					vbox = {
						visible = "[And( GetPlayer.MakeScope.Var('pantheon_send_kind').IsSet, And( GetPlayer.MakeScope.Var('pantheon_send_recipient').IsSet, GetPlayer.MakeScope.Var('pantheon_send_recipient').GetCharacter.IsAlive ) )]"
